03 错误，导致 Kubernetes 读取探针（Readiness Probe）探测失败。**\n\n1. **应用层故障确认**：日志 (fact-24b1a9562a58) 明确记录了 8 次 `dependency unavailable` 且 `http_status: 503`；Tracing (fact-5a0e422f0500) 独立观测到 `GET /work` 持续返回 503。\n2. **Kubelet 判定依据**：Kubelet 在探测 `/ready` 时收到了 503 状态码（fact-cc905f5a6835）及连接拒绝（fact-5730eca6aea1），导致 Pod 条件 `ContainersReady` 和 `Ready` 均为 `False`（fact-2f679417a212）。\n3. **局限性说明**：虽然确定了是“依赖不可用”导致的问题，但关于“底层依赖服务（如数据库或微服务）为何不可用”以及“`/ready` 端点代码与 `/work` 路径的具体关联逻辑”属于 **未确认** 环节，需要进一步排查依赖服务状态及应用代码实现。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.3m\n├─ 问题定位: 17.3s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 44.0s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-09/workload-5f4fb9ff45-cfzz6: 44.0s (Evidence 35.3s, RCA 8.5s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 16.6s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-09/workload-5f4fb9ff45-cfzz6**: pod-notready-probe-failed\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 77.918, "metrics": {"run_id": "d991cdad9fe94fa1", "mttr": {"value": "1.3m", "seconds": 77.92620015144348, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-notready-probe-failed", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "sco